description:
The a553 audit (cargo test -p catalog-browser --test browse -- --ignored audit_every_catalog_preview) reported 342 previews ready and 14 problems on 2026-10-08. Examples:
- missing symbols: g-con:Conn_PIC_TagConnect_TC2030 and g-ics:TP4333;
- footprints that aren't in the library they name;
- one part with nothing assigned;
- footprint fields listing ';'-separated alternates.

The legacy CSVs and libraries are frozen import fixtures, so make corrections as reviewed edits in the canonical catalog rather than changing database/, symbols/ or footprints/.
